 of the struggles that people go through. It's made me dig deeper into my music to try to capture those feelings.\n[S25T10] (dia_id: D25:10)\n\nDave: That's cool. Using your music to share experiences and feelings, is it cathartic for you?\n[S25T11] (dia_id: D25:11)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, it's a way for me to express myself and work through my emotions. It's like my own form of therapy.\n[S25T12] (dia_id: D25:12)","text_sha256":"8244566ac0275e8130d38810deff3464c326e1af6c836ea8deeac983c31c5af6","timestamp":"2023-10-23T14:17:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":1597,"filesystem_tool_calls":5,"model_calls":6,"orchestration_calls":2,"prompt_tokens":74701,"provider_request_attempts":6,"provider_rounds":5,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":76298},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"3a6c8a077746b1297c02152b53359533cbb02d6f8488ea56f51ce9894d112b3c","filesystem_tools_sha256":"6d9d68f047917d20adb9133168d5726233c9719dbefd54627e08827832d963c6","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3506af86ae75acd7ce07f88bae7a25e1bfec56a5b1c9f44abd3d71a2e6f4eb2d","paper_prompt_id":"filesystem-appendix-a3-prompt-6-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"4d89230b7718f28f8770faaabede2d4a3ea6ce2e174a1883f2923d371d36f6f2"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"What inspired Calvin's recent music?","question_id":"conv-50-q132","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-extension20-v2","run_position":18,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"7f7dd4b5ddf8244447a802f1c6dffd1b320538f55e11581c25a82c13ddfd6737","runtime_contract":{"evidence_budget_limit":16000,"evidence_budget_unit":"characters","round_limit":20,"runtime_sha256":"685c1e746bf530aee67161d8bf562357f07c1